{"route":"/docs/4.0/content/figures/","version":"4.0","renderedVersion":"4.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Figures","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for displaying related images and text with the figure component in Bootstrap."},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Anytime you need to display a piece of content—like an image with an optional caption, consider using a <code>&lt;figure&gt;</code>."},{"id":"content--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Use the included <code>.figure</code> , <code>.figure-img</code> and <code>.figure-caption</code> classes to provide some baseline styles for the HTML5 <code>&lt;figure&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;figcaption&gt;</code> elements. Images in figures have no explicit size, so be sure to add the <code>.img-fluid</code> class to your <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> to make it responsive."},{"id":"content--example-1","type":"demo","key":"e6336909e1b9496f12df","height":147},{"id":"content--code-1","type":"code","value":"<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"figure-img img-fluid rounded\" alt=\"A generic square placeholder image with rounded corners in a figure.\">\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>","language":"html"},{"id":"content--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Aligning the figure’s caption is easy with our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/utilities/text/#text-alignment\">text utilities</a>."},{"id":"content--example-2","type":"demo","key":"fcf72ed709082e6c1ced","height":147},{"id":"content--code-2","type":"code","value":"<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"figure-img img-fluid rounded\" alt=\"A generic square placeholder image with rounded corners in a figure.\">\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption text-right\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>","language":"html"}],"demos":[{"key":"e6336909e1b9496f12df","html":"\n<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <img data-src=\"holder.js/400x300\" class=\"figure-img img-fluid rounded\" alt=\"A generic square placeholder image with rounded corners in a figure.\">\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"fcf72ed709082e6c1ced","html":"\n<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <img data-src=\"holder.js/400x300\" class=\"figure-img img-fluid rounded\" alt=\"A generic square placeholder image with rounded corners in a figure.\">\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption text-right\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Theming","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/theming/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/build-tools/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Grid","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/layout/grid/"},{"en":"Media object","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.0/layout/media-object/"},{"en":"Utilities for layout","href":"